# The wind pin (docs/design/wind.md Phase B): `wind pin` fixes the vector the
# per-frame wind state uses, `wind unpin` frees it, reduced motion stills sway.

case pinned wind sets direction and readout, unpin frees it
start walk raft
click
lock
frame 50 x2
press Backquote
expect mode = console
type wind pin 5 0
expect console.text = wind pin 5 0
press Enter
lock
frame 50 x2
expect console.last = wind pinned to (5, 0)
expect wind.dir.x ~ 1
expect wind.dir.z ~ 0
expect wind.readout = wind E 5.0 b/s (gust 0.42) R 0.47 x0.76
press Backquote
type wind unpin
press Enter
lock
frame 50 x2
expect console.last = wind free
expect wind.readout != wind E 5.0 b/s (gust 0.42) R 0.47 x0.76

case reduced motion keeps the readout real but stops sway
start walk raft
click
lock
frame 50
press Backquote
type wind pin 0 5
press Enter
lock
reduced off
frame 50 x2
expect wind.sway > 0
reduced on
frame 50 x2
expect wind.sway = 0
expect wind.dir.z ~ 1
expect wind.readout = wind S 5.0 b/s (gust 0.42) R 0.47 x0.76
